    "referenceSolution": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <set>\n#include <map>\n#include <queue>\n#include <deque>\n#include <stack>\n#include <numeric>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <climits>\n#include <utility>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){int n;long long target;cin>>n>>target;vector<long long>a(n);for(auto&x:a)cin>>x;long long l=0,r=*min_element(a.begin(),a.end())*target;while(l<r){long long mid=l+(r-l)/2,count=0;for(auto x:a){count+=mid/x;if(count>=target)break;}if(count>=target)r=mid;else l=mid+1;}cout<<l<<'\\n';}\n",
